# Cloudflare Pages redirects (301s) for retired page URLs.
# Add a line here every time a page is renamed or merged — see DOCS_FORMAT.md.

# Serve the sitemap at the conventional root path /sitemap.xml (what crawlers and
# AI agents probe, and what Cloudflare's "agent ready" check expects). Starlight's
# bundled @astrojs/sitemap emits the URL set as sitemap-0.xml (+ a sitemap-index.xml
# wrapper); a 200 rewrite serves that flat <urlset> at /sitemap.xml with HTTP 200,
# so it regenerates with every build and never goes stale. sitemap-0.xml stays the
# single file until 45,000 URLs (we have ~50), so no other shard is missed.
/sitemap.xml /sitemap-0.xml 200

